Z||000000||trigger||08-04-2000||07:13 PM||||Hi,<BR>Just want to vent.  I got a ticet at the beginnig of May.  The guy did some smokeshow to catch me or something.  He pulled me over for turning to sharply.  I barely touched it!!  The black corsica ahead of me had to be doing at least 65 in the 55.  The white mustang behind me was spinning the tires.  I was under the speed limit the whole time.  After he pulled me over he then proceeded to harass me for driving a sports car ("Well, son I won't get you for accelerating to quickly since that tiny little 4 cylinder car won't spin the tires") yeah up yours.  Sorry bout the language.  He then looked over my car real close before taking 20min. to write out the ticket.  Man was I ticked off.  Well, sorry it's so long.  Thanks for listening and letting me vent.<P>------------------<BR>Honestly officer, I was just keeping up with the flow of traffic.  I know there aren't any cars in the area, that's how far behind I am.||||reg||8
Z||000001||Standard||08-04-2000||08:50 PM||||Wow, that sounds like a complete b.s. ticket.  I would take it to court if I were you..||||reg||1
Z||000002||Robert||08-04-2000||09:14 PM||||On the other side of the pendulum, when I was a youngster, one of the tickets I once got was for following to close on the freeway.  The Highway Patrol Officer pulled us both over.  I only got the ticket for following to close; the other guy got a ticket for doing 85mph   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>BTW:<BR>This guy in front of me wouldn't move over so I could pass him....... LOL<P>Following to close was a minor ticket, 85 MPH is a major ticket.<BR><P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://canterburytrails.com/photo/T2.GIF"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Gokart||08-04-2000||09:46 PM||||Hope I don't jinx myself here but I've been extremely lucky since I've had my GT about a year and a half now. I was on a streak for a while with previous cars getting a ticket every 3/4 months. The only time I've been pulled over was a while back when the cop started telling me my GT quarter windows were illegally tinted! Man did he feel like a moron when he stuck his head in the car and noticed that they weren't actually real windows  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> He goes..."your all set"! I felt like saying "No s**t Sherlock". You should've seen him trying to use his little tint depth tool on the quarter windows <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Gokart_sig_1.gif">  <P>Marc                     87GT<p>[This message has been edited by Gokart (edited 08-04-2000).]||||reg||7
Z||000004||fierospeeder||08-04-2000||10:35 PM||||thats a LOL<BR>I havn't driven my fiero lately, but its the vehicle i have gotten the most tickets with.<P>I might be because it has the appearance of a sportcar, eventhough my 84 is intended to be an economy car.  I sometimes felt like one of my tickets shouldn't have happened, speeding on a side street from a stop position with my 4 cylinder.  I dont think i can get it that fast, 35 i believe, in one block distance, and im pretty sure i wasn't flooring it.  <P>  ||||reg||1
Z||000005||trigger||08-05-2000||08:53 AM||||Hi,<BR>I just payed it and didn't go to court.  It cost like $50.  I wasn't happy.  On a better note I am 15 with a learners permit and a school license. (He got coming out of school)<BR>I haven't lost my license.  First offense on a school license and I should have to take remedial drivers training and a month with no license.  However, if they would have taken it on time it would have been in the middle of the summer which is when my car sits for all week.  Wish I had a license.<P>------------------<BR>Honestly officer, I was just keeping up with the flow of traffic.  I know there aren't any cars in the area, that's how far behind I am.||||reg||1
Z||000006||rogergarrison||08-05-2000||05:36 PM||||you never win in court plus u lose a days pay to boot. What i did when i got one of these "B.S." tickets was go to the bank and get my cash exchanged for pennies. took it to court house in suitcase. First they said they couldnt except it like that but i informed them my lawyer said it was government currency and they had to take it, lol. they were pissed, took the assistant police chief and 2 clerks a couple of hours to count. I got revenge in my own mind, bet they wont stop me anymore either.<P>rg ||||reg||1
